# Product Vision

Read `docs/PRODUCT_VISION_V3.md` and `docs/PRODUCT_COMPLETION_DIRECTIVE.md` before work.

## What LaunchLens is

**AI Strategy Project Manager** — not chat, not report tool, not business-plan writer.

AI understands project → builds Workflow → makes Decision → proposes next action. User **approves**.

## Rule

> **기능을 구현하지 말고, 사용자의 경험을 구현하라.**

Completion = full quality bar in Directive v7 (UX through Production deploy).

## Journey north star

~3 min: Landing → Goal → Workflow → Workspace → GO/HOLD → Execution  
Daily reopen: Morning Brief · Confidence · Decision · Progress

## UX requirements

- Landing: storytelling — no feature grids or tech spec lists
- Single primary CTA per screen · AI leads · Thinking UX on wait
- Workspace: AI PM tone (Today, Coach, Decision) — not dashboard widgets

## Examples

```tsx
// ✅ One CTA, AI recommendation copy
<Button>프로젝트 시작</Button>

// ❌ Feature grid on Landing
<LandingFeatures cards={[...12 items]} />
```
